  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "こうげきを　うけても\nＨＰを　かならず　１だけ　のこせる。\nれんぞくで　だすと　しっぱい　しやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "공격을 받아도\nHP를 반드시 1만큼은 남긴다.\n연속으로 쓰면 실패하기 쉽다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "即使受到再強烈的攻擊，\n也一定會剩下１ＨＰ。\n連續使用時容易失敗。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur résiste aux attaques avec 1 PV.\nPeut échouer si utilisée plusieurs fois de suite.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Nach fatalen Attacken bleibt stets 1 KP übrig.\nMisserfolg bei Wiederholung möglich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Resiste cualquier ataque y deja al menos 1 PS.\nPuede fallar si se usa repetidamente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa resta con un PS anche se subisce un\ncolpo da KO in quel turno. Usata in successione\npuò fallire.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user endures any attack with at least 1 HP.\nIts chance of failing rises if it is used in succession.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "攻撃を　受けても\nＨＰを　必ず　１だけ　残せる。\n連続で　だすと　失敗しやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "即使受到攻击，\n也至少会留下１ＨＰ。\n连续使出则容易失败。",
      "version_group": {
